sequenceDiagram
  participant K as Keystone
  participant H as Hook
  K->>H: describe
  H-->>K: targets, formats
  loop each fence
    K->>H: transform
    alt renders
      H-->>K: Markdown<br/>and asset
    else refused
      H-->>K: diagnostic
    end
  end
  Note over K,H: one socket per request
